  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "For a given chemical reaction&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>. Concentration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&nbsp;changes from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mmol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>dm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mmol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>dm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Rate of&nbsp;appearance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;times the rate of disappearance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> which is twice the rate of disappearance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>. The rate of appearance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math>&nbsp;has been experimentally determined to be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mmol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>dm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Therefore the rate of&nbsp;reaction is____<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mmol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>dm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;(Nearest Integer)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>milimole</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>dm</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>sec</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>milimole</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>dm</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sec</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Rate&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>(i)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>(ii)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>(iii)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p>So, if</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>than</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>9</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mi>Rate</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>reaction</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>dm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
